// # Catalog Scripts Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 4 build entry points plus the path guard.
//          They exec OODA_COMPILER as argv. They do not print fake success.
//
// Setup: Each script has a single purpose. They compose: build -> test -> verify -> release.
//        .github/ is release wiring, not product.
//
// Beats:
//   1. build.oo — oodac check on package ANCHOR.oo files. No payload imports.
//   2. test.oo — oodac check on qa/ drivers. Double-run.
//   3. verify.oo — ANCHOR presence, 256-line cap, no VERSION, catalog shape.
//   4. release.oo — verify + test. Push to main is the release.
//   5. script_path.oo — refuse `..`, shell metacharacters, and whitespace.

import "build.oo";
import "test.oo";
import "verify.oo";
import "release.oo";
import "script_path.oo";
